PR #2473  overall: bug_confirmed
Spec: Removed spec language that suggested implementing wide counters via trap handlers, because trap-emulated upper halves break the non-atomic safe-read sequence and yield silently corrupt counter snapshots.
  [BUG] drivers/perf/riscv_pmu_legacy.c:46-64  pmu_legacy_read_ctr
